; A module whose declarations are all `pub`, for
; `930-selective-import.ax`, which imports only one of them by name.
;
; `sibling` is public and the import does not ask for it. That is the
; second way a declaration can fail to be exported, and it used to
; delete this module's own call to it exactly as a missing `pub` did -
; `resolveDeclsPhase` asked one question with two `&&`ed halves.
(pub :: sibling (-> Int Int))
(pub fn (sibling n) (* n 3))

(pub :: viaSibling (-> Int Int))
(pub fn (viaSibling n) (sibling (sibling n)))
